[{"sha":"c7d1ff00bd505a7d5f078922aca4a441a81b5125","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGM3ZDFmZjAwYmQ1MDVhN2Q1ZjA3ODkyMmFjYTRhNDQxYTgxYjUxMjU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-22T21:06:19Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-22T21:06:19Z"},"message":"fix(infra): remove invalid root interpreter path (#4972)\n\nVS Code no longer warns that `./.venv/bin/python` cannot be resolved\nwhen opening the repository root or its worktrees.\n\n---\n\nThis monorepo has no root Python project or root virtual environment.\nEach package owns its environment inside its package directory, so the\nrepository-level interpreter setting pointed to a location that should\nnot exist. Removing the default lets Python tooling discover the\nappropriate package environment instead.\n\nAI assistance was used to prepare this change and description.","tree":{"sha":"872e9e3b19f68e27f86a574b2e75884c92fb8298","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/872e9e3b19f68e27f86a574b2e75884c92fb8298"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/c7d1ff00bd505a7d5f078922aca4a441a81b5125","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYTDLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAMEQAB/IlK1z2WxsHI6A2FJltNZC\nBRt68GmINglREyQA0DFY6BZdSDDtDFGLXqI5TojhZlDYZID2qRLzrwtSv60pbG0v\nY+sjRmm9GPZk4xeAVbHIZVpTkMGvol5/ceJYKd6s8+qP7wJ6B9znVOlkiifBBPjs\nSLOD/NmXlCfnyIRh6qE8eRhGtG9+z4PfbJ7FR6FDRJudjiloOuhFlIAitz1qVe0t\nHRw4m2ixrCo3y9sZSHLHKhiEi5ji9oou+ELdf7tW92fPCeHt3IFw0+fWy9lldk+d\nqrojtyWShDlWDXNF8fNmkh67pEm5ElK2s5DEv1euaIgVeXpCJ/udxN8tSX47rEmQ\nmZVny9j+MxKFPV4zCcfmgt/UjA/SW5S70CnPEvZKaP6DS32N3ex9LjgJUkm/hHTm\nKqkQapv6tRuWgaY2B3cLCRbBBCUrdVq+dORuS20xA/pCCxsTEWqpQYIWvleJZlMD\nlkxBxx1fZAR+NFNgfcSrwc/WODPormLSe+dwm7O4p8NQny2qJ9B3K9qCylWjsOjA\n92buzUtEaUcsd1POWOVlO9b+Zszff/QKbvyWrwqbzqhsPdJs83hbOK38F4nR7n4J\nIfIo8YCbbaNdS8xCjF0UfXHTXdkZq7gD9TSVzLVWebNL6X6pxo9FyU+O/6gLZ43d\n4Q1JRaEuYQe0nMF8RlbH\n=wMeP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 872e9e3b19f68e27f86a574b2e75884c92fb8298\nparent dc49075cd280dcf396a52073d19d8897c42bc5ae\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784754379 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784754379 -0400\n\nfix(infra): remove invalid root interpreter path (#4972)\n\nVS Code no longer warns that `./.venv/bin/python` cannot be resolved\nwhen opening the repository root or its worktrees.\n\n---\n\nThis monorepo has no root Python project or root virtual environment.\nEach package owns its environment inside its package directory, so the\nrepository-level interpreter setting pointed to a location that should\nnot exist. Removing the default lets Python tooling discover the\nappropriate package environment instead.\n\nAI assistance was used to prepare this change and description.","verified_at":"2026-07-22T21:06:19Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c7d1ff00bd505a7d5f078922aca4a441a81b5125","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/c7d1ff00bd505a7d5f078922aca4a441a81b5125","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c7d1ff00bd505a7d5f078922aca4a441a81b5125/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","eve