il":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-22T02:36:02Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-22T02:36:02Z"},"message":"chore(evals,code): drop deprecated GLM-5/5.1, Nemotron 3 Super, Kimi K2.5 (#4930)\n\nStops offering GLM-5/5.1, Nemotron 3 Super, and Kimi K2.5 in eval and\nHarbor model selections before their July 24 upstream Model API\ndeprecation.\n\nThe registry and workflow dropdowns retain the supported GLM-5.2 and\nKimi K2.6 replacements plus the intentionally supported Groq Kimi K2\nInstruct and Baseten Nemotron 120B A12B entries. Generated model groups\nand fixture-only references are updated accordingly, while NVIDIA\nprovider scaffolding remains in place for synthetic tests and\nempty-matrix behavior.","tree":{"sha":"2f5cfbd017577edbe88359c749d1cb382e1b28e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/2f5cfbd017577edbe88359c749d1cb382e1b28e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/0a539734bda64ea71f8766ca74d4e0ab51432caf","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYCySCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAS0EQAID03ZMzptRj5Sy70GiogNGP\ngknvp25dFuCCOYlpQdB342ygSu4Zi53kE8JXhfFkwbkqzN7CCyjVmvnTJ6U8Xf8F\nyapkr6W5eY7PENulZEB2aZKMyRlEQZE1TOmcLnlplb4vr10lln7bupZ5n2rg6awD\nc23M77PnV8gD777nRE1foN5c09UKGcAdBtdyeU2gVV2ctlfiDxOtrr3ZUcfHUIce\nDPDhUWUSv1sdK61vP1nWhEX6Ax7XjmXSvK8KC6xyHF4+z086JalfxXrLiQ7x4lYP\njz9iaHpcWDzM4Be+4E67iVzXtOKkafJVi93OxOqFzqomQooBKh+a5DpOP6c+SmuH\nCaJNlS0ecfGjSfp5PC9YVwQx6AL0Gfwd5iiba26abi6Mnh+IWtrUWGo3U8HytGRo\nors7Nbor6AtCpenEums6TIqEwoxCnB71hC088flfB1GOKsiTKHeRheglRCAxjG+7\nfaqFjrK6WLNT4CNEgzgF7fyjnMKz6fRZp8p6z5AnS3A+l1JTPsKxM1bI6ML9FYOY\nDmvx8+I1Gr2ywrvYgVQuKniQ5Kqk4/MJQgcUQo1py3IOAQgezJgNMEGIC29ttgoJ\nmZ7Ab6t5BYZHsZk3xnCJKlvhPpv/aMmGL1VWQEgDg5LyLJJe5lfKma15jAvii0Z4\nlLh9p5w9F/XmCuR8xFIQ\n=UEp+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 2f5cfbd017577edbe88359c749d1cb382e1b28e4\nparent c063438eb06e255cde2744f6ac281e3a78882416\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784687762 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784687762 -0400\n\nchore(evals,code): drop deprecated GLM-5/5.1, Nemotron 3 Super, Kimi K2.5 (#4930)\n\nStops offering GLM-5/5.1, Nemotron 3 Super, and Kimi K2.5 in eval and\nHarbor model selections before their July 24 upstream Model API\ndeprecation.\n\nThe registry and workflow dropdowns retain the supported GLM-5.2 and\nKimi K2.6 replacements plus the intentionally supported Groq Kimi K2\nInstruct and Baseten Nemotron 120B A12B entries. Generated model groups\nand fixture-only references are updated accordingly, while NVIDIA\nprovider scaffolding remains in place for synthetic tests and\nempty-matrix behavior.","verified_at":"2026-07-22T02:36:02Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/0a539734bda64ea71f8766ca74d4e0ab51432caf","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/0a539734bda64ea71f8766ca74d4e0ab51432caf","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/0a539734bda64ea71f8766ca74d4e0ab51432caf/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_even