 race the fallback.\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c010ad4f94a6c4bad6c4f42eee41483894083dbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/c010ad4f94a6c4bad6c4f42eee41483894083dbb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/c063438eb06e255cde2744f6ac281e3a78882416","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYCxuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwH8QAB6SqxhKc15E1+2nIYrHY2Jd\nmSHeAx4VRn34d1bBGfKA4Ncoq8Z8JqhWmhGbgs0bEbUs5xkHZC/XtS1tFe+qitHu\nsqF7GDAvB8tGJPAa0GD67N9Yuf6MzsI8QvFbcszJfXO/xCvTo3KOtGsm0AOYjL8H\nrlBjPN7pvzn9bu05gbgF8B32ID3Cr5BC/ZNsEVZvpNVyOa0vy4xO2P4gEuwbs/va\nb5sn/7gPSNEG5ACxK2veYY41Xt+DD0c+BMB9jj2AkvsTpFNY8x66sSAZcLqHYrG5\nTojXlPFZyOxZ0Gcp3TmMS8wSD7bL00LDoAeo3Z5/9xjSx1Ry5kUvkg0DubPDldJv\ny0HgaIAPWylT4IW2inlLJUMD5lzwdiBMKM+AdPn9LQ18nvP/Ilc+mTq4N1gssHWB\nbWAIlBLSx6sZR3hZzgUiYgEWyfTEe8XrzRd/z2VzACjrflG8MJyc+4vlHMcexPZf\ndlDJQ3ld+MqmAITlny5GAdc3L9WudUXUb5gdJhOxHgj/pHHiWiaCCiaymoL6xU8q\ni80z0KsubCu2/joC3g4zY2odOeeZzUvb7BBC4ShmfSPwRD/UHoKj+0EseyjLIm0r\nORjD8FCYp9B831qO02ET4EkTthsyYYwrI4YSD1bzozKiMVbBDGl0TNExYtmUUMi3\nqD2l1HwgAfvo0x0dhesF\n=kGdP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree c010ad4f94a6c4bad6c4f42eee41483894083dbb\nparent 1b15a3310a80339e85816dd01425e708690d28ad\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1784687726 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784687726 -0400\n\nchore(deps): bump uv to 0.11.31 (#4933)\n\nBumps the uv pin in `.github/actions/uv_setup/action.yml` from `0.11.26`\nto [`0.11.31`](https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/releases/tag/0.11.31).\n\nOpened automatically by `bump_uv_pin.yml`. Mirror availability on\n`releases.astral.sh` was verified before this PR was created, so CI\nshould not race the fallback.\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-22T02:35:26Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c063438eb06e255cde2744f6ac281e3a78882416","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/c063438eb06e255cde2744f6ac281e3a78882416","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c063438eb06e255cde2744f6ac281e3a78882416/comments","author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"1b15a3310a80339e85816dd01425e708690d28ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/1b15a3310a80339e85816dd01425e708690d28ad","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/1b15a3310a80339e85816dd01425e708690d28ad"}]},{"sha":"1b15a3310a80339e85816dd01425e708690d28ad","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDFiMTVhMzMxMGE4MDMzOWU4NTgxNmRkMDE0MjVlNzA4NjkwZDI4YWQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-22T02:35:15Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-22T02:35:15Z"},"message":"docs(repo): document pre-release note enrichment (#4934)\n\nAlpha and other pre-releases bypass release-please, so their initial\nGitHub release bodies contain generated scaffolding but no curated\nchangelog section. This documents how to enrich those bodies safely\nafter publication.\n\nThe new guidance mirrors the regular release-note automation's editorial\nrules, preserves the workflow-generated warning, attribution, and Git\nlog, and gives coding agents a review-first prompt plus focused `gh\nrelease edit` verification commands.","tree":{"sha":"67ef53b2653e2827ec5b373ca337c1aa1c6af356","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/67ef53b2653e2827ec5b373ca337c1aa1c6af356"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/1b15a3310a80339e85816dd01425e708690d28ad","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYCxjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWcoQAGRZOhQHbkD4RjngwvG7m5wn\nIWgrRVZidHcAiHan9BNWYEtvdMKRml5wkpPl796KupBqXUaAwGnbu7lTCIM7FlK1\nuSmcR7xiZNwxY+N3I9DyxL+2IPBcFYqJ6Q7EdiuOUU/fwTtxs7E5Vu815ow+qGus\nIEUvk7LhwCOCShzKOH8+/DkHbi336Rh29g63t3Se6F6lJmkdrYFfsfstLLUWH+tz\nA+sVmfM553Un+dJT7xBqhDRTgb0Q52x+cEPOcIGRjOyV/Jxao6X6O2E8nFfLxxhi\nysmtivel2WXPoss/AUUT248xBqVMGBF9yPmpzYekkdMBrJEfGQTvsuoGyGguQBaQ\nsDAUJrPgFB6DdS8blo0vpObHkN6rUIDXQ1INsQDVy/xZ/FA3pcowbanA73ivUVUZ\nTgWgUKLrb0hblb/X7SGpY2cVG1aK4ZN6NxXfy+ZBXp95tTzm5L2vIEMO3XDrTamS\nQCOdRC7STjVIh+eJh3pguYSvvD5u8O61bvLQWBeElUI2ZhQipnhKS94m7ug0Ceal\nQQ7LIQxRtaTlA/41qEViYC8Ec37ojcGKQQF/IFo765MkiL+XQMID0Va6fxCVpK+u\ncmKSrUrV3SQrO+fibcPDDTsHQvFGfIPa0GRVxSicoH2L/jdffdybJCuZB29o6AKn\ngpVWKv2Yt36g3lGJER/t\n=r7Er\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 67ef53b2653e2827ec5b373ca337c1aa1c6af356\nparent 005f9bb4d790e6cd92be8712ec86cd45192b699f\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784687715 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784687715 -0400\n\ndocs(repo): document pre-release note enrichment (#4934)\n\nAlpha and other pre-releases bypass release-please, so their initial\nGitHub release bodies contain generated scaffolding but no curated\nchangelog section. This documents how to enrich those bodies safely\nafter publication.\n\nThe new guidance mirrors the regular release-note automation's editorial\nrules, preserves the workflow-generated warning, attribution, and Git\nlog, and gives coding agents a review-first prompt plus focused `gh\nrelease edit` verification commands.","verified_at":"2026-07-22T02:35:15Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/1b15a3310a80339e85816dd01425e708690d28ad","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/1b15a3310a80339e85816dd01425e708690d28ad","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/1b15a3310a80339e85816dd01425e708690d28ad/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"005f9bb4d790e6cd92be8712ec86cd45192b699f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/005f9bb4d790e6cd92be8712ec86cd45192b699f","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/005f9bb4d790e6cd92be8712ec86cd45192b699f"}]},{"sha":"005f9bb4d790e6cd92be8712ec86cd45192b699f","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDAwNWY5YmI0ZDc5MGU2Y2Q5MmJlODcxMmVjODZjZDQ1MTkyYjY5OWY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-22T02:06:04Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-22T02:06:04Z"},"message":"fix(code): route `ctrl+x` to focused `ask_user` input (#4926)\n\nFix `ctrl+x` in `ask_user` prompts so the external editor opens with the\ncurrent draft and returns focus to the answer field.\n\n---\n\nThe `ctrl+x` external-editor action only recognized the goal-review\neditor and the chat input. When the focused surface was an `ask_user`\nanswer field — either a free-text question or the \"Other (type your\nanswer)\" input revealed for a multiple-choice question — it fell through\nto the chat-input branch. That opened the editor against the (usually\nempty) chat input instead of the field's current draft, and on return it\nfocused the chat input rather than the originating `ask_user` field.\n\nThis adds a `_focused_ask_user_editor` check that mirrors the existing\ngoal-review path: when a visible, attached, focused `AskUserTextArea`\nowns focus, the editor round-trips its `submitted_value` (expanding\ncollapsed-paste placeholders), resets paste state afterward, and\nrestores focus to that same field.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/949e7490-b2bd-9d30-96ed-14cd763fb545)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"d184bed23876ae751781880e1a5d4c1f179ad239","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/d184bed23876ae751781880e1a5d4c1f179ad239"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/005f9bb4d790e6cd92be8712ec86cd45192b699f","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYCWMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGlAQADUpkl9KZIjMReBkO6JqVsqH\n7QRBXUGAe4Gar2Srdw89unSiTG8cH6Mo60q1OZ+BSTit2yqVROaayk4kM92hnnsV\nT8JIPvyjGI/f5vHT/N1UIFGGb0/AX2uNtgjL82lj2VQVNsWOUTWHmAmIt1gDtXuo\nE4GsZ5hYr/ca0yRLpiEVJyj6eH4WXVzbCTiBdjLypacQ5KDkYuF66S8CtcdedgSk\nYVfmiL8U745sexZh3OWC3brFgGA+E5J8ngHP6gBGhTVGUWnxTJ287yar2RyDheGb\n8BEdLC7dQkWBjh1SnuJTpwUn1fLW021WjIy4S8nEGbPJHHdfxSFifvyhMOAEbyVH\nPBMsZlJQXcVGFiCw4cFCZS5bl7euxBaBnnSH10muSqaeKLt+LOuCXuQ9uAYQrSg7\n+rc4lqyZbLEkRBqE7tfs7Ki4RDXoE4Ej1KRfNXhVZd89SQVPHduQ0Zv9f0p2D4XG\nFbc37eIRvriumcsYoiEnleiaidEdrPdvjG/N2pYOIK4/KSGOI51jce3x0URU3bnN\ns1V7elg5yQEIKpYRiMCHAITqOOzNpgZscMpmzQ4eTqx+s0x71ZlEP53WCmUkym6V\nCF7z8oSTuFqMFljkJ1lktN1IceElvEjaoejDuk7nx5n1y/RRwedop1geyH0ERu4a\nRo7r2iEqMRLByH3iSw/5\n=0zZJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree d184bed23876ae751781880e1a5d4c1f179ad239\nparent 7475fdad708e5c1c534c977416ef84dbe8c5d0e6\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784685964 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784685964 -0400\n\nfix(code): route `ctrl+x` to focused `ask_user` input (#4926)\n\nFix `ctrl+x` in `ask_user` prompts so the external editor opens with the\ncurrent draft and returns focus to the answer field.\n\n---\n\nThe `ctrl+x` external-editor action only recognized the goal-review\neditor and the chat input. When the focused surface was an `ask_user`\nanswer field — either a free-text question or the \"Other (type your\nanswer)\" input revealed for a multiple-choice question — it fell through\nto the chat-input branch. That opened the editor against the (usually\nempty) chat input instead of the field's current draft, and on return it\nfocused the chat input rather than the originating `ask_user` field.\n\nThis adds a `_focused_ask_user_editor` check that mirrors the existing\ngoal-review path: when a visible, attached, focused `AskUserTextArea`\nowns focus, the editor round-trips its `submitted_value` (expanding\ncollapsed-paste placeholders), resets paste state afterward, and\nrestores focus to that same field.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/949e7490-b2bd-9d30-96ed-14cd763fb545)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-22T02:06:05Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/005f9bb4d790e6cd92be8712ec86cd45192b699f","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/005f9bb4d790e6cd92be8712ec86cd45192b699f","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/005f9bb4d790e6cd92be8712ec86cd45192b699f/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"7475fdad708e5c1c534c977416ef84dbe8c5d0e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7475fdad708e5c1c534c977416ef84dbe8c5d0e6","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7475fdad708e5c1c534c977416ef84dbe8c5d0e6"}]},{"sha":"7475fdad708e5c1c534c977416ef84dbe8c5d0e6","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDc0NzVmZGFkNzA4ZTVjMWM1MzRjOTc3NDE2ZWY4NGRiZThjNWQwZTY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-22T02:04:45Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-22T02:04:45Z"},"message":"docs(code): clarify MCP plugin reload guidance (#4928)\n\nPlugin manager guidance now tells users to run `/reload` to make newly\nadded MCP tools available, without implying `/reload` and `/restart` are\ninterchangeable.\n\n---\n\n`/reload` is the normal action after plugin changes: it rediscovers\nplugins and rebuilds the agent. `/restart` remains available as a\nseparate recovery command. This changes only the plugin-manager wording\nand its assertions; command behavior is unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"02d43121bc0b7edc036ad9010c172ef5f36d1bca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/02d43121bc0b7edc036ad9010c172ef5f36d1bca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/7475fdad708e5c1c534c977416ef84dbe8c5d0e6","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYCU9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAtkQAG9xKyPfoo9VnYrjNTIhsO9v\nPvLLcN9TvY+ny+a2TvpyxLVxLvaN81SczcNl3YSIwVOljmGrgrR9zC7GWDwVcxPv\nO9dR8O+/WYJws27Q/HVBsv8Z4xS1m6VU/iOcnqrM+ipCPqN12MlFcwOg/lpOLW/1\njqHvS7i1Xr8ZGHHavtq3GQVMiwe5PWHCAeF0IpEvEs5WN2G3vRmSoiwaV5nk/Lgd\nw9ZEMCa15M9VyvaDbOBZak7UQXmFDxVhlEUMYpX6Vwc2RcCls8x6XKu66pKmUwNP\nG2w/44+B98ra2nd53y+LcmqzQXL4AnajiIXqfpIOHJUUb06+WNOt9Jg7AsDMWweG\n0HE2rcUTnIbop4u+TULTnfNlsNhBjxXD//nikotLFpvwjD0cz5tFvr83kK/pOYcs\naOtCmqGI5UCeHXo3E5b3KBRPHzgFlUjRNWsmVHo6ut7Ea/R9XDpy1VsSjlZDOqN3\nj6zIzkXhl8pSh7xLXYwoeYyYbeqLmKkeCeL2JCwHrne0bw67zglvy4twKpfix3z9\nj+ZMdWUO5IU+fna3psqyaXNBrKkbrCB/fPnY3grDZGEmpjeQQNU150PzM6xlDGdi\n+SjJnvOSbQzVV7QaWSLvVLMhDrwLmoQLkc8p25icdrGuxnwbA6EtLYLtWxhQoTsA\nnZ2i1YM2LxoD1X42i8cN\n=+xlo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 02d43121bc0b7edc036ad9010c172ef5f36d1bca\nparent 045ec811bb345c7a8cd4d47dee19ccf10bb7a5ef\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784685885 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784685885 -0400\n\ndocs(code): clarify MCP plugin reload guidance (#4928)\n\nPlugin manager guidance now tells users to run `/reload` to make newly\nadded MCP tools available, without implying `/reload` and `/restart` are\ninterchangeable.\n\n---\n\n`/reload` is the normal action after plugin changes: it rediscovers\nplugins and rebuilds the agent. `/restart` remains available as a\nseparate recovery command. This changes only the plugin-manager wording\nand its assertions; command behavior is unchanged.","verified_at":"2026-07-22T02:04:45Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7475fdad708e5c1c534c977416ef84dbe8c5d0e6","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7475fdad708e5c1c534c977416ef84dbe8c5d0e6","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7475fdad708e5c1c534c977416ef84dbe8c5d0e6/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"",