1afab4f1b","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/44d9dec39b2570d16c285a8b0a99cbe1afab4f1b"}]},{"sha":"44d9dec39b2570d16c285a8b0a99cbe1afab4f1b","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDQ0ZDlkZWMzOWIyNTcwZDE2YzI4NWE4YjBhOTljYmUxYWZhYjRmMWI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-20T20:08:59Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-20T20:08:59Z"},"message":"feat(code): show experimental mode in splash and debug console (#4863)\n\nWhen `DEEPAGENTS_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL` is set, `dcode` now surfaces that\nunstable behavior is active — an `(experimental mode)` tag on the\nstartup splash (alongside the existing `(debug enabled)` tag) and an\n`Experimental` on/off row in the Debug Console snapshot.\n\n---\n\nExperimental behavior was previously invisible, so users couldn't tell\nwhen the flag was in effect. The splash tag mirrors the `(debug\nenabled)` pattern (its own themed style helper, ANSI fallback, rendered\neven when the version is hidden, ordered debug → experimental → local).\nThe Debug Console gains an always-present `Experimental` field so the\ndiagnostic snapshot reports the flag state directly.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/6cb12589-9525-8da6-05db-a4134a7ea44a)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"febb4a27c78ca33269fbbb0a33373837259871d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/febb4a27c78ca33269fbbb0a33373837259871d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/44d9dec39b2570d16c285a8b0a99cbe1afab4f1b","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXoBbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+oYQACl/tsvXKKORrW3SgLp0AuIN\nlFZZeA+jC9ESaw8WvS7qs9gLfF+OJ8khpd6NVzmZgCGLaYH+ZBA8MZbCszh8eRXi\nGVzegw2f6yCQnKN24uhVJSrJCOeZZut6ZXdsLSk4fg4klG3h4gj4JPlcS7BuvVxk\nvSpWkXTxSf2nPFISEpjI8bJ25pci9i3NHCkNoq/J/y6VHCKob0mLOSnkbU8DJYfI\ndsg5f02uU21Pb90+bEWi9pTvf3GX+nGU0EDPa43bkM+f2zK/yZXSZiAqlCfRh/8l\nQe2/XoBCW1gwdz2mEqubngZyQNRmiBflz96ArBCtxXsDP7simK0D65K/NxzSOln+\nV8dfJ24TBIZcSqHSdm8gApuyjz6KaNuAr5sF3+Dp+0TBFgB6bAiHBP+RH448NvbX\nmy9P7B5U64aKMu9D/iP+JIMbbkWytfuO2o8du3WpiYOJb8UWNcoQKS7ul2EpkhRX\nH34J/4DT/YsPHJ2rnMH8W7hL8ApEAdd2AVB2BFSi2Z0a6zo853yrZgjmG0wN6Djz\ncp5CczJGa5cdv6wY93ROn4FUEfME5pYMspDDlp3xKlii5thNm/dHl5SQ5gAl6Z31\nwYuAmpqfZze22U2BKsf409jC7pOkfK/Pz4fOMUVa7t6aWe4hVfjdxU0xIP4SXE4w\nbT7MP77+Mzlos2vsdpYS\n=nIwT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree febb4a27c78ca33269fbbb0a33373837259871d3\nparent 22969c05389effb6aa73ddc0e67b422869946e98\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784578139 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784578139 -0400\n\nfeat(code): show experimental mode in splash and debug console (#4863)\n\nWhen `DEEPAGENTS_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL` is set, `dcode` now surfaces that\nunstable behavior is active — an `(experimental mode)` tag on the\nstartup splash (alongside the existing `(debug enabled)` tag) and an\n`Experimental` on/off row in the Debug Console snapshot.\n\n---\n\nExperimental behavior was previously invisible, so users couldn't tell\nwhen the flag was in effect. The splash tag mirrors the `(debug\nenabled)` pattern (its own themed style helper, ANSI fallback, rendered\neven when the version is hidden, ordered debug → experimental → local).\nThe Debug Console gains an always-present `Experimental` field so the\ndiagnostic snapshot reports the flag state directly.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/6cb12589-9525-8da6-05db-a4134a7ea44a)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-20T20:09:00Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/44d9dec39b2570d16c285a8b0a99cbe1afab4f1b","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/44d9dec39b2570d16c285a8b0a99cbe1afab4f1b","comments_ur