ts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/acb1a0eeec60deca267282a085970445a582a5e1/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"1a1f06f506d5a167609de336cced740151b6615a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/1a1f06f506d5a167609de336cced740151b6615a","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/1a1f06f506d5a167609de336cced740151b6615a"}]},{"sha":"1a1f06f506d5a167609de336cced740151b6615a","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDFhMWYwNmY1MDZkNWExNjc2MDlkZTMzNmNjZWQ3NDAxNTFiNjYxNWE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-20T18:13:34Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-20T18:13:34Z"},"message":"fix(code): hide `Auto` option in approval widget when ineligible (#4839)\n\nApproval prompts no longer suggest enabling Auto mode when it is\nunavailable (experimental opt-in off).\n\n---\n\nThe HITL approval widget always offered \"Enable Auto for this thread\n(a)\" even when Auto mode is ineligible (e.g.\n`DEEPAGENTS_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL` is off or a sandbox is active), where\nchoosing it only surfaced the \"Auto is available only in the opt-in\nlocal TUI beta\" warning and did nothing. `ApprovalMenu` now takes\n`auto_mode_eligible` (passed from `App._auto_mode_eligible`) and omits\nthe Auto option when it can't be enabled, dynamically renumbering\noptions and quick keys. A live Auto fallback still shows its\nSwitch-to-Manual affordance.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/6c5eb368-e615-f9d7-b8d0-bbce9ebaa3ff)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"81aaf5c0702750204c7b929458baffd1dcdb37e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/81aaf5c0702750204c7b929458baffd1dcdb37e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/1a1f06f506d5a167609de336cced740151b6615a","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXmVOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMvQQAGhPYN57F8ls/x560yThgnLP\n14ZKKAZ9TY7Tu7ba97XqHqQ5fcDPH5X0Is209Q47LZdKN0OG+POp4t4XlrJ0jTCd\ntdNZ5vA/+Ii0kycR0H1kUASU5VSyvb3siJN5MpBQJ6aP6u/4kPZKESG1Ydo8HO4L\nYAvqg3U6DZWXvLn3mKUUNrAsMmlVffOvocJRVfNjOnyGAwY9j5Fw7zgf5cGjWcuG\nRILGuOWLAGDycrDceOtxmfW4MDRC/jDwo4IDx9xkTEVZTQ8DXkIVNTVr/MiIHSGv\nnHfbQg5cyZODSzw5UQe6iKv6K7Jcvdg9nBL9WSQe05xUM7mROwe99qyUw/1UQHR/\nj790jZECCjOCKlsbkn4ydCtHhTSeiTuIz7MxD4jRyd1RuccxgDoFOvA725lWid5U\nNhgryujCAT0H3WXReLctncseTrKTROLT2J2Uz541g+QS3sgXAVDq4c9Ig3QGsqOe\n97RtIQjef5awEr+uD7f9PbNG2AB1Lcegdd9asCRsaiLIIGQIMgKBYc5rihFEjR5p\nrqQORrdkaZtC+FYzDQvPUS6MXFVtll7u+CcbUimCnqZfaMmTpesw9Irsvi0+7486\nSo3xjQvLD03nIWDQbha3uwLj6s9IurgCpGNBviGJ8PMV0cT8EHEG2/lG3fRCBgKi\nkXpgPnj1Fzth83yGRupI\n=Psz8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 81aaf5c0702750204c7b929458baffd1dcdb37e8\nparent 63d5e03bb743ae40628a2ea1251fac519a7345a5\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784571214 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784571214 -0400\n\nfix(code): hide `Auto` option in approval widget when ineligible (#4839)\n\nApproval prompts no longer suggest enabling Auto mode when it is\nunavailable (experimental opt-in off).\n\n---\n\nThe HITL approval widget always offered \"Enable Auto for this thread\n(a)\" even when Auto mode is ineligible (e.g.\n`DEEPAGENTS_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL` is off or a sandbox is active), where\nchoosing it only surfaced the \"Auto is available only in the opt-in\nlocal TUI beta\" warning and did nothing. `ApprovalMenu` now takes\n`auto_mode_eligible` (passed from `App._auto_mode_eligible`) and omits\nthe Auto option when it can't be enabled, dynamically renumbering\noptions and quick keys. A live Auto fallback still shows its\nSwitch-to-Manual affordance.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/6c5eb368-e615-f9d7-b8d0-bbce9ebaa3ff)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-20T18:13:35Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/1a1f06f506d5a167609de336cced740151b6615a",